OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre clock to return to
OL,4,Aoriginal site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn iconic shopping centre water clock
OL,7,Fis set to return to its original
OL,8,Flocation once repairs are complete.
OL,10,FThe 23ft (7m) Emett Clock, in
OL,11,FNottingham's Victoria Centre, was taken
OL,12,Faway from its current location on the
OL,13,Fupper floor near the York Street
OL,14,Fentrance to the centre in May.
OL,16,FBut preparations are now under way to
OL,17,Freturn the timepiece to the centre's
OL,18,Fmain foyer off Lower Parliament Street,
OL,19,Fwhere it was first installed in 1973.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
